  "description_short": "Family-run garden restaurant serving hearty home-cooked meals amid the ancient forests of Tsitsikamma.",
  "description_long": "Nestled along the N2 in the heart of Tsitsikamma, Tilly's Restaurant offers a welcome respite for travellers exploring the Garden Route. The restaurant sits within the grounds of Tsitsikamma Gardens Self-Catering Cottages, surrounded by indigenous forest and well-tended gardens that create a peaceful atmosphere away from the road.\n\nThe kitchen focuses on honest, home-cooked South African fare — think generous breakfasts, hearty lunches, and comforting dinners that hit the spot after a day of hiking or exploring the nearby national park. The menu caters well to families and groups, with friendly service that reflects the personal touch of a family-run establishment.\n\nConveniently located between Nature's Valley and Storms River Village, Tilly's makes an ideal lunch stop or overnight base for exploring the Tsitsikamma region. The combination of comfortable accommodation and wholesome food in a tranquil forest setting has earned it a loyal following among both tourists and locals.",
